; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   100   \DESCRIPTION    Function call with pointer to element of deque dynamic data. Precondition assures that a valid
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   101                   deque pointer is provided to this function.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   102   \COUNTERMEASURE \M [CM_OS_DEQUE_DYN_M]
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   103  
